```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as Sprint End (Cron / Event)
    participant Action as GitHub Action / Bot
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant CLI as wow CLI
    participant Output as Retro Output

    Cron->>Action: Sprint ended (schedule or Jira webhook)

    Action->>CLI: wow show --trigger retrospective --format json
    CLI-->>Action: Rules tagged with retrospective

    Action->>GH: Fetch merged PRs for sprint period
    GH-->>Action: PR data (reviews, CI status, time-to-merge)

    Action->>Action: Analyze PRs against each rule

    Note over Action: For each rule, calculate:
    Note over Action: - Compliance rate (%)
    Note over Action: - Violations list
    Note over Action: - Trend vs. last sprint

    Action->>Output: Generate compliance report

    alt Output = Slack
        Action->>Output: Post sprint health summary to #team channel
    else Output = GitHub Issue
        Action->>Output: Create "Sprint N Retro Prep" issue with findings
    else Output = Dashboard
        Action->>Output: Push metrics to tracking system
    end

    Note over Output: Team uses report as retro input
```
